{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "2f9422f570b6ea91b40416a72c209a88fe00b7c5ad79dcdd2f8160afe2fd9073", "ja": "はじまりのはじまり", "zh": "最初的起点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a1cc7373083532e071d958889fd6602ef0b4bf3dfce49e27eacc5603c37ad5ec", "ja": "劇場の新しい企画『STARDOM ROAD』が\n始動。約1年かけて紡がれる物語の最初の\n公演は桃子、海美、まつり、風花が\n出演する事に。メンバーはお互いの理解を\n深めるため、交流会を開く。", "zh": "剧场的新企划《STARDOM ROAD》正式启动。历经约1年编织而成的故事，首场公演将由桃子、海美、茉莉和风花出演。成员们为了加深彼此的了解，举办了交流会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c37e915963de32ce3d9a44b714b798228a0e8412ad5dd215c76c330a6bb68419", "ja": "（社長と何度も相談した結果、第一回公演のメンバーが\n決まった。早速みんなを集めて、ミーティングだ)", "zh": "（和社长商量了很多次之后，第一场公演的成员终于定下来了。先把大家召集起来开个会吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ba4fed331b50975167dea109cf81476d5003186abac73ff9a3ccce8760b2fc9d", "ja": "……というわけで、今回は\n1年を通して、公演を行う予定だ。", "zh": "……所以，这次预定在1年期间举办公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5ae3bcd4031f56f5e472ccc5ba3d3eddda938581e83557ae07116f593de8fc26", "ja": "その記念すべき第一回公演を、\nみんなにやってもらうことになった！　よろしくな！", "zh": "这场值得纪念的首次公演，就交给大家来完成了！拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "a1c530f3fb48cdc3feab57e028bc8822589acdb03dd9e0b64523e35d7a6bd1e8", "ja": "わぁ～！　私たちが、一回目！？\nやったーっ！", "zh": "哇～！我们是第一场！？太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "733f752cd9d9277bea70b2e11e18522676dbc46a033387174880bc4c4dc9c851", "ja": "最初の公演に姫たちを選ぶなんて、\nさすが、{$P$}さんなのです！", "zh": "第一场公演就选了我们姬们，\n真不愧是{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7565b81e34536b64c80c377f834b41c64d563d8901cc8859dc4f789b63bdb3c5", "ja": "うん！　なんだか、とっても嬉しいなぁ……♪\n桃子ちゃんも、嬉しい？", "zh": "嗯！总觉得特别开心呢……♪\n桃子，你也开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "cd6e106421cec1fb8f18e4393fd5f379904e3e06fee6448e3405ebf757cb6d57", "ja": "う、うん。\n……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "2b0d750919f2b4be7cfbf7d1888062318a1680223a54041be0c1f7daff0547b5", "ja": "それで、どんな公演をする予定なの？\nお兄ちゃん。", "zh": "那么，打算举办什么样的公演？\n哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "56e76373a08aca8c9e02fe1686442b64350b3a3d57b17426bf11a8385b389385", "ja": "劇場を使って毎月公演を行い、1年をかけて\nひとつのストーリーを見せる公演だ。", "zh": "这是利用剧场每月举办公演，历经1年\n展现一个完整故事的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d5f56aa6e1d984f93a621851d62ebe91c1076c3c6217175f9e0b762ab0e6ee64", "ja": "もちろん、歌もお芝居もあるぞ！", "zh": "当然，既有唱歌也有演戏哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "1c891ea7b8185fd237f83d9052553a3508d41144e6389df3479cb00e16b706f2", "ja": "歌もお芝居も！？\nうわーっ、楽しそう！　盛りだくさんだね！", "zh": "唱歌和演戏都有！？\n哇——听起来好有意思！内容真丰富啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "947c97899e74db45230d16fd6a11333c3f27b61c4098e7b1e0290a7f80f0d01d", "ja": "1年をかけて、ひとつのお話を……。\n壮大な企画ですね。", "zh": "花上1年的时间，来讲述同一个故事……\n真是个壮大的企划呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3dbc7827fc08230c5a8350576bc1bcf6894677c0b8c4459f386b65625e154933", "ja": "ああ。月替わりで、配役を色々と\n入れ替えながら公演をしていく予定だけど……。", "zh": "嗯。计划每个月更换不同的角色阵容来进行演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e655196ba1d9a415ca2b2444ca82a39693c8c64d85d86eb2683a7ab5180be007", "ja": "今回は、主人公が小さい頃からスタートする。\nそこで主演は、桃子にお願いしたいと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "这次会从主人公小时候开始。\n所以我想请桃子担任主演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "e79c00e5ab49dc5d96e4c7da40a158b8f36d4d6e92d49af5b9cafcac7ebbecb4", "ja": "……えっ。\n桃子が、主演……。", "zh": "……诶。\n桃子来演、主角……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "6cff0af27f37e0b37565e97683e2c95388fce447098f9fea125829538cee4b10", "ja": "ふ、ふーん……。\nそうなんだ……。", "zh": "哦、哦……这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "6991a1bc72d314f006eabc4df0cbee03ed3d690f5814aac33f66f64165f985a7", "ja": "おめでとうなのです、桃子ちゃん♪", "zh": "恭喜你，桃子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "df859a5f52eaa1eeccb5c2f96ea87f4377928af4afc237becab9c188d47cd60b", "ja": "ま、まあ桃子なら、\nどんな役だってカンペキにできると思うけど。", "zh": "虽、虽然是桃子的话，我觉得不管什么角色都一定能完美演好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "e4f65d7f28a1f2b866829b2b315092fea3e60925a1466774cfeecb6e81cda569", "ja": "うんうん！\nももちんが主役だったら、絶対いい公演になるね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n要是桃子当主角，公演肯定会很精彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5bec54721a9a5de06286e4c013cc271a11d6cd9d2b67b775c0df31bcc020834b", "ja": "私もそう思うな。\n一緒に頑張ろうね、桃子ちゃん♪", "zh": "我也这么觉得。\n一起加油吧，桃子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "af3710c1a8b6053f4c360fa195863fc1745578a542c0ade549e500ad23352ca9", "ja": "！　……うん！\nよろしくね、風花さん。", "zh": "！……嗯！\n请多关照，风花姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "ad4c7479bfa4987c9bf8a62b7ac5526ae5c2318e03b0d02625bd33f8454e5255", "ja": "最初って、すっごく大事だからね。経験者の桃子を\n主演にするのは、いい考えだと思うな。", "zh": "第一印象非常重要嘛。我觉得让有经验的桃子来担任主演，是个好主意哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1a2429971dab64388e495580e45dc40ad220f9c2efba5664c75a6c42f06a5c19", "ja": "もちろん、アテにしてるよ！\nこの4人なら、いい開演セレモニーができると思う。", "zh": "当然，我很看好你们哦！\n我觉得由你们4个人来的话，一定能办出一场精彩的开演仪式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "f43dc0c7130329cd92d246666dfe2da46054449e7d748e89dc4f9ff167c37e37", "ja": "はいなのです！\n姫たちが、わんだほー！なスタートを切るのです！", "zh": "是的！\n公主们要以精彩绝伦的方式开启演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "4830eb19433e8f9f97b2ea01a460e9cdf51d80514eba8bd84e2ead63f8d538ce", "ja": "トップバッターか～。\nうーっ、燃えてきた～っ！！", "zh": "第一个出场啊～。\n呜——开始燃起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "6463db7a93ab509c04de237faa5b730a8c88d80153b166b6d3a620b95b90f8c6", "ja": "それじゃ、早速だけど、\nみんなで交流会しようっ！", "zh": "那么，事不宜迟，大家一起开交流会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "d20a5089a42305408ad332a76f58b5464a88df120c0ad45105ccc16389005be0", "ja": "交流会？\n……って、なに？　海美さん。", "zh": "交流会？……那是什么呀，海美姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "9d97e8e09b5a29f9c8cf31561df3b23f92ec364e339b702a0a9e2ee32dd7a2ca", "ja": "うん！　だって私たち、これから公演終わりまで、\nず～っと一緒にいることになるんでしょ！？", "zh": "嗯！因为从现在开始到演出结束为止，我们都要一直待在一起了，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eda89671a7bb5ff858190ad8463121a1b09add6f6bbf38e2a06441170f30d602", "ja": "あ……だから交流会をして、\nお互いの理解を深めよう、ってことかな？", "zh": "啊……所以是要通过交流会，加深彼此的了解，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "d23720cd0be0e81a23afd7d690760f3d72adcdc9face0dd1fe6ff1a25f410b16", "ja": "そうそう、それ！\nさすが、ふーちゃん！", "zh": "对对，就是这个！\n不愧是风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "b0814ed71ac4ec762f5c0cbf8009badc7c0001cd8c14ba05cafca0709b5c5a6b", "ja": "なるほどなのです！\nそれなら、姫も賛成なのです♪", "zh": "原来如此！\n这样的话，公主也赞成哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "66df7c756dc6f64d6aca3043751cc70f0a5c2c0f7d5de143e46073c21a92b6ae", "ja": "桃子も、別にいいけど。", "zh": "桃子倒也没意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "0fac84d781222c507bd8805bc8b0ff780aa293fd8ba5307a0fd2b10146e24a08", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、みんなで\nお菓子と飲み物買いに行こうっ！", "zh": "那么那么，大家一起去买点心和饮料吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "360dae798623a08fd2d1a3387d1c687f94c68265708d456b883f75f787af15d6", "ja": "（その後、4人は、交流会を思い思いに楽しんだ）", "zh": "（那之后，4人各自享受了交流会）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "aa6d83d3b8b2b9b01866881747ec27714e335cb8a85cff2e47a70e8b20170d86", "ja": "（仲も理解も深めた今なら、最後まで\n手を取り合い、駆け抜けていけるはずだ！）", "zh": "（既然现在已经加深了彼此的感情和理解，就一定能携手并肩，一路冲到最后！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
